{
  "id": "143",
  "title": "Getting A Haircut",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2016-07-06",
  "synopsis": "Little Wang goes to cut his hair, but gives the barber a difficult demand for his new haircut.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/169/4a79791363cca3fffc57f7d811c43c3d30ff8e6e.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "剪头发\n\n一天，小王去剪头发。理发师问小王：“小伙子，你要剪个什么发型？”\n小王说：“给我剪一个能找到女朋友的发型。”\n理发师听后，点了一根烟，说：“唉……考验我毕生所学的时候到了！”",
    "traditional": "剪頭髮\n\n一天，小王去剪頭髮。理髮師問小王：“小伙子，你要剪個什麼髮型？”\n小王說：“給我剪一個能找到女朋友的髮型。”\n理髮師聽後，點了一根煙，說：“唉……考驗我畢生所學的時候到了！”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Getting A Haircut"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天，小王去剪头发。",
      "traditional": "一天，小王去剪頭髮。",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān xiǎo wáng qù jiǎn tóu fa",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "理发师问小王：“小伙子，你要剪个什么发型？”",
      "traditional": "理髮師問小王：“小伙子，你要剪個什麼髮型？”",
      "pinyin": "lǐ fà shī wèn xiǎo wáng xiǎo huǒ zi nǐ yào jiǎn ge shén me fà xíng",
      "english": "One day, Little Wang went to get a haircut."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The barber asked Little Wang: “Young man, what hairstyle do you want?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小王说：“给我剪一个能找到女朋友的发型。”",
      "traditional": "小王說：“給我剪一個能找到女朋友的髮型。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo wáng shuō gěi wǒ jiǎn yí ge néng zhǎo dào nǚ péng you de fà xíng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Wang said: “Give me a haircut so that I can find a girlfriend.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "理发师听后，点了一根烟，说：",
      "traditional": "理髮師聽後，點了一根煙，說：",
      "pinyin": "lǐ fà shī tīng hòu diǎn le yì gēn yān shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "“唉……考验我毕生所学的时候到了！”",
      "traditional": "“唉……考驗我畢生所學的時候到了！”",
      "pinyin": "ài kǎo yàn wǒ bì shēng suǒ xué de shí hou dào le",
      "english": "Upon hearing this the barber lit a cigarette and said:"
    }
  ],
